    "turn_text": "Well, think about this. You've got the majority whip, the number three, Jim Clyburn in the Democratic Party. He is the one who pretty much made Joe Biden the nomination, South Carolina. He endorsed him, and he turned the whole Democratic campaign around and won him, won the race for him. He literally said when the COVID virus came forward, this is a perfect opportunity to restructure government in our view. Joe Biden just said this in a fundraiser last night. So when you wonder, when you sit in this room and you come to it from an argument like we have a crisis, Secretary of Treasury comes in and says, we're running out of money in this program. This program is working. Would you be willing to provide more money to a program? No policy changes. Nothing else on something you just voted on two weeks ago. I said yes. And they said, well, wait a minute. Now we have a little leverage because you need this, right? Well, we want a little something else.",
